 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (6)': ISB Operations / Empire's Sinister Agents, Coruscant: Docking Bay, Prepared Defenses ('Prepared Defences') and the three Effects it pulls (Mobilization Points, Imperial Arrest Order & Secret Plans, There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement); these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Imperial Arrest & Secret Plans' dested Imperial Arrest Order & Secret Plans; 'Twilek Advisvor' dested Twi'lek Advisor; 'Nemodian Advisior' dested Neimoidian Advisor; 'Prince Xisor' dested Prince Xizor.",
  "Posted 'Lt Pol Treidum' dested Lt. Pol Treidum; 'Corporal Obrek' dested Corporal Oberk; 'Corporal Dedram' dested Corporal Derdram; 'P59'/'P60' dested P-59/P-60; 'Probe Droid' dested the Hoth Dark droid.",
  "Posted 'Zuckus In Mist Hunter' dested Zuckuss In Mist Hunter; 'Ig88 in Ig2000' dested IG-88 In IG-2000; 'Vibro Ax' dested the Dark Vibro-Ax; 'Drop' dested Drop!.",
  "Posted 'Tatooine' dested the Dark Premiere Tatooine system (the post does not say Premiere or Coruscant printing); 'Naboo' dested the Dark Naboo system; Tatooine sites dested their Dark pages.",
  "Sebulba's Podracer and Darth Maul were posted on their own lines after the Locations section; the author notes 'dodgy numbers' from pasting out of Word. The list totals 60.",
  "The author says the deck normally finishes 3rd at a local (unnamed) tournament."
 ],
